[h2]Build 0.9.10[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Colonists view now lists what a colonist brings besides skill levels: their expertise (with Vanilla Skills Expanded), and any traits and genes that change skills or work stats. Each line shows the effect and which kinds of work it helps; ones that make them worse are in orange.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
